      "help_en": "The ID of the region where the zones are located. You can call https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html to query the most recent region list",
      "help_zh": "可用区所在的地域ID。您可以调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html查看最新的阿里云地域列表",
