      "help_en": "Specifies whether to display detailed information.\n\ntrue: Display detailed information.\nfalse: Do not display detailed information.\n\nDefault value: true",
      "help_zh": "是否展示详细信息。\n\ntrue：展示。\nfalse：不展示。\n\n默认值：true",
